From 47548f485b383329ba391684b55bb80f4a8758ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:36:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] build(sdk): upgrade TypeScript SDK and npm tooling

Move the workspace to pnpm 12.12.1 and the SDK to TypeScript 6, ESLint 10,
Jest 30, tsup 9 and zod 4, preserving the security pins as pnpm-workspace
overrides and the seven-day minimum release age.

Refs: holdmyspot-com/codex-unleashed#72
Base: openai/codex rust-v0.163.0
(83086188ae0614bd882818ff1aa23f3194962012).
The patch requires no other downstream patch.

TDD: on the base, pnpm outdated -r lists 17 trailing direct dependencies;
afterwards only TypeScript 7, which current typescript-eslint and ts-jest
reject. pnpm 12 drops the root overrides until they move to the workspace
file; Prettier 3.9 rejects threadOptions.ts until it is reformatted.
